The message is only informational and can in everyone=B4s knowledge be =
considered harmless in this case.
It may however also point to a bad chip on the interface card in other =
cases.

Dr Blinn assuaged me that the driver from where this message comes is =
very careful not to let this problem affect other interfaces which it is =
handling. He also advised also to keep the latest patch-level which may =
have fixed previous driver bugs, and that perhaps installing a loopback =
cable on it
would make the message go away.

Michael



