     So, the question is, did something change with dupatch on Kit 3?  We
have used this method without problem for ERP's with 5.1B Kit 2 and for some
time with 5.1.  Is there a better way to do this or will there be a fix?  I
didn't want to have to specify individual patches when installing ERP's.
Thanks.
--Joe




